OL,3,GNEWSAButlin's safety staff to strike
OL,4,Aover bank holiday
OL,5,
OL,6,FButlin's safety staff are due to strike
OL,7,Fover the bank holiday weekend in a
OL,8,Fdispute over pay and changes to the
OL,9,Fworkplace.
OL,11,FMembers of the United Voices of the
OL,12,FWorld (UVW) union working at Butlin's
OL,13,Fin Bognor Regis will walk out from
OL,14,FFriday 28 August to Sunday 30 August
OL,15,Fover concerns about staffing, equipment
OL,16,Fand working conditions which it claims
OL,17,Fmakes jobs "harder and less safe".
OL,19,FA Butlin's spokesperson said guests "do
OL,20,Fnot need to change their holiday plans"
OL,21,Fand it has made arrangements for the 19
OL,22,Fstriking staff.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
