OL,3,GNEWSAButlin's safety staff to strike
OL,4,Aover bank holiday
OL,5,
OL,6,FUVW general secretary Nelly Ospino
OL,7,Fsaid: "Our members have been absolutely
OL,8,Fclear: they do not want to strike. They
OL,9,Fwant Butlin's to sit down with them and
OL,10,Fnegotiate a solution."
